   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## LTX-2.3 GGUF - STG + APG (RTX 3090)\n\nExercises the two STG/APG fixes in this fork:\n\n- `apply_apg=True` used to raise `TypeError` immediately -- `apg()` was\n  called with a `momentum_buffer` argument it does not accept.\n- APG's `project()` ran in float64; consumer Ampere runs fp64 at 1/64\n  rate. Now fp32 (2.39 ms -> 0.73 ms per call).\n- STG index counting is now correct when guide-mask attention splits a\n  self-attention into several calls.\n\n`stg_layers_indices` is per sigma band; `[29]` targets one block.\nSet `preset` to a named preset to drive the string fields from it."
   ],
   "title": "Read me"
  }
